        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#545B64;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Security controls: TLS enforced • WAF (OWASP managed rules + rate limit) • AWS_IAM auth on data methods • preflight OPTIONS unauthenticated by design • least-privilege IAM • CloudWatch logging • AppConfig validators (JSON-Schema + Lambda) + gradual rollout with bake time. Serverless — no VPC. Sample code, non-production." vertex="1">
